        {
          "comments": "NOT REVIEWED — raw running config supplied for manual review; no automated pass, finding, or applicability decision asserted.",
          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 14e32fd444871f594a733bad16f6c9998b6eeb7de6fa2a9254faaedefde040c5\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: 78ef8994694f1f0f2529c8aaa4942d24d01b7db8cf7ec9592c1dfbfb595b4846\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Disable features that should not be enabled unless required for operations.\n\nSW2(config)# no feature telnet\nSW2(config)# no feature dhcp\nSW2(config)# no feature wccp\nSW2(config)# no feature nxapi\nSW2(config)# no feature imp\n\nNote: Telnet must always be disabled.",
